layout.page.odd.number.area	[270,325,804,824]
layout.page.odd.number.pattern	[0-9]+
style.heading.1.alignment	centered
style.heading.1.fontSize	12
style.heading.1.isAllCaps	true
style.heading.1.isBold	true
style.heading.1.level	1
style.heading.1.startPatterns	INTRODUCTION   MATERIALS?\s*AND\s*METHODS   RESULTS   DISCUSSION   CONCLUSIONS?   ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS   REFERENCES   R[ÉE]SULTATS   MAT[ÉE]RIELS?\s*ET\s*M[ÉE]THODES?   REMERCIEMENTS   R[ÉE]F[ÉE]RENCES(\s*BIBLIOGRAPHIQUES)?   BIBLIOGRAPHIE
style.heading.2.alignment	left
